  "purpose": "A frame that watches light receives device.event {type: light, lux} for the ambient light in lux. The first reading after the watch posts. A later reading posts only when it differs from the last posted lux by at least 10% of it (the 5% and 9% readings post nothing, the 11% reading posts) or crosses 1 lux (0.95 after 1.05 posts although it is under 10%; 0.97 after 0.95 posts nothing), and never less than 1000 ms (atMs, on the host's monotonic clock) after the last posted event: the large change at 1900 ms is dropped, not deferred. A reading that posts nothing does not move the last posted value or time. 0 lux is a reading.",
